    core:proteinSubcellularLocationText "Cell membrane {ECO:0000269|PubMed:11741969, ECO:0000269|PubMed:12176756, ECO:0000269|PubMed:12181424, ECO:0000269|PubMed:15454078, ECO:0000269|PubMed:15863612, ECO:0000269|PubMed:16299511, ECO:0000269|PubMed:17071743, ECO:0000269|PubMed:17224476, ECO:0000269|PubMed:20953164, ECO:0000269|PubMed:24728418, ECO:0000269|PubMed:26253506, ECO:0000269|PubMed:27218670, ECO:0000269|PubMed:29078335, ECO:0000269|PubMed:29742403, ECO:0000269|PubMed:7737988, ECO:0000269|PubMed:8099908, ECO:0000269|PubMed:8392192, ECO:0000269|PubMed:9013606, ECO:0000269|PubMed:9087614, ECO:0000269|PubMed:9607315}; Multi-pass membrane protein {ECO:0000305}. Cell membrane, sarcolemma {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P15381}; Multi-pass membrane protein {ECO:0000305}. Perikaryon {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P22002}. Postsynaptic density membrane {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P22002}. Cell projection, dendrite {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P22002}. Cell membrane, sarcolemma, T-tubule {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q01815}. Note=Colocalizes with ryanodine receptors in distinct clusters at the junctional membrane, where the sarcolemma and the sarcoplasmic reticulum are in close contact. The interaction between RRAD and CACNB2 promotes the expression of CACNA1C at the cell membrane. {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P15381}." .

